Third-party assets
------------------
The demo sample (Packages/com.accesscalibrate/Samples~/Demo/Resources/AccessCalibrateDemo/Models)
uses 3D models from "Ultimate Platformer Pack" by Quaternius (https://quaternius.com),
released under CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication):
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
Only the models used by the demo are included; they are unmodified.

Font
----
The calibration screens use the Manrope typeface (Copyright 2018 The Manrope Project
Authors, https://github.com/googlefonts/manrope), licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1. The license text is included next to the font files:
Packages/com.accesscalibrate/Runtime/UI/Resources/AccessCalibrate/Fonts/OFL.txt
The included files are static instances (weights 400, 500, 600, 700, 800) generated with
fontTools from the variable font published in the Google Fonts repository; glyphs are unchanged.

